## Overview

Globema has been an IQGeo partner since 2006, making it one of our longest-standing relationships. Globema has developed a deep knowledge and expertise of the IQGeo product set, and the ability to deliver sophisticated and complex network management implementations with a proven methodology.

Globema is headquartered in Warsaw, Poland with offices in the USA, Canada and Bulgaria and serves clients in North America and Europe with many long-term engagements. Globema has a specialist team of consultants who focus exclusively on the IQGeo NMS and OSPInsight platforms.

They deliver services including:

*   Full-lifecycle IQGeo NMS implementations
*   OSPInsight implementations
*   Data migration
*   Systems integration
*   Custom development
*   Training

Globema serves clients including fiber-optic network operators, utilities, and cable operators.

**Website:** globema.com
**Email:** contact@globema.com
**Phone:** +48 22 331 82 42

