## Webinar recap: IQGeo fiber network design with Globema

*Published on October 7, 2024*

Globema and IQGeo co-hosted a webinar in September 2024. In the webinar, Globema's team demonstrated fiber network design workflows and best practices using the IQGeo platform. The webinar was attended by over 150 participants.

Key topics covered:

*   End-to-end fiber network design using IQGeo
*   Integrating GIS data into the design workflow
*   Network validation and quality assurance in IQGeo
*   Exporting data for downstream use (construction, permitting, etc.)
*   Customer case studies from Globema's implementations

The webinar highlighted Globema's consulting expertise and deep knowledge of IQGeo's platform, particularly for fiber-optic network operators and cable operators in North America.

The recording is available on request through IQGeo's website.

